# The code-health review's step G: quit while Connect to Server's gio hangs without asking anything
# (a paused server; run.sh's stand-in sleeps 30 s on mount). quit_workers waits for the connect
# thread until CONNECT_QUIT_MS from the moment every worker was told, then kills gio by its pidfd:
# run.sh checks the window is gone well before the stand-in would have ended.
settle
key ctrl-l
type smb://nas/pub
key enter
wait-for 3000 conn=1
quit
